  "term": "depressive spectrum",
  "definition": "Depressive spectrum refers to viewing depressive status as a continuum rather than a simple yes-or-no category. In this study context, it describes the clinical gradient running from healthy controls through subthreshold depression (SD) to major depressive disorder (MDD).",
